      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Line of Accounting (LOA): born in 1956, still used in US bureaucracy.\nConditional space-escaped format, primarily suitable for mainframes.\nDescribes expenses: appropriation, cost center, patient ID, etc.\nNeeds a whole bunch of <if> statements for each specific context.",
